        "requires": ["pointRelationships"]
      },
      {
        "id": "src185-angles",
        "description": "The smaller inner/rightward arc is phi_1 between the farther upper ray and lower ray; the larger outer/leftward arc is phi_2 for the nearer object. Both labels sit below the common baseline. Exact arc radii are readability additions, not printed measurements.",
